{
    "title": "My Little Blood Cult *Horror*",
    "description": "Welcome to My Little Blood Cult, a scary, addictive, and horrifying cult quest that redefines the world of fishing. Are you ready for a gacha demonic fishing adventure like no other?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 WHAT THE H*LL?\r\n\r\nPrepare to lead your devoted cult on a demonic fishing adventure that transcends the ordinary. Your followers, bound by unwavering loyalty, eagerly await your command. Together, you'll embark on an extraordinary quest to capture demons, monsters, and other unearthly creatures. Become the most powerful cult known to man by summoning and building an impressive collection of demonic entities!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa3 DEMONIC FISHING ADVENTURE\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in a realm of witchcraft, spells, and strategy as you navigate the shadowy depths in pursuit of your mission as a demon summoner. Engage in the ultimate demonic fishing adventure, capturing creatures that dwell in the abyss. Summon demons & monsters to complete your eerie collection and unlock the secrets of this spooky realm. Every day is Halloween here.\r\n\r\n\u26d4 NOT YOUR GRANDMA\u2019S FISHING GAME\r\n\r\nThis is not like all your boring other games. This adventure requires a delicate balance of hunting skill and magical luck. Dive into a captivating fishing game with loots infused with ancient Wicca spells and superstitions. Cast your bait into the abyss, luring and capturing hundreds of demons lurking below. \r\n\r\nUtilize the power of alchemy to transmute your ill-gotten loot into potent bait, summoning and capturing the most terrifying demons in existence.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude08 EXPLORE SCARY DEMONIC WORLDS\r\n\r\nDiscover the secrets of haunting oddities, scary worlds, and sacred altars as you lay claim to monsters and demons drawn from the legends of mystery. Unveil a world of blood, spells, and evil ghost spirits as you strive to become the ultimate demonic cult leader.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdc SIT TIBI VENARI PROSPERUM\r\n\r\nAn ancient Wiccan spell echoes through the ages, beckoning you to seize your fate and conquer the abyss. Sacrifice, Capture, Collect! Showcase your prowess as a deathly slayer and monster hunter, capturing demons and completing your demonic collection. Beware, for sometimes sacrifices of your collections and cultists are required.\r\n\r\n\u2757 DISCLAIMER\r\n\r\nDillo Interactive and MLBC are not actual demonic cults \u2013 we\u2019re just from Austin. We don\u2019t care who worships what. Our only desire is for you to love our weird little game and share it with others. <3",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to My Little Blood Cult, a scary, addictive, and horrifying cult quest that redefines the world of fishing. Are you ready for a gacha demonic fishing adventure like no other?<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 WHAT THE H*LL?<br><br>Prepare to lead your devoted cult on a demonic fishing adventure that transcends the ordinary. Your followers, bound by unwavering loyalty, eagerly await your command. Together, you&#39;ll embark on an extraordinary quest to capture demons, monsters, and other unearthly creatures. Become the most powerful cult known to man by summoning and building an impressive collection of demonic entities!<br><br>\ud83c\udfa3 DEMONIC FISHING ADVENTURE<br><br>Immerse yourself in a realm of witchcraft, spells, and strategy as you navigate the shadowy depths in pursuit of your mission as a demon summoner. Engage in the ultimate demonic fishing adventure, capturing creatures that dwell in the abyss. Summon demons &amp; monsters to complete your eerie collection and unlock the secrets of this spooky realm. Every day is Halloween here.<br><br>\u26d4 NOT YOUR GRANDMA\u2019S FISHING GAME<br><br>This is not like all your boring other games. This adventure requires a delicate balance of hunting skill and magical luck. Dive into a captivating fishing game with loots infused with ancient Wicca spells and superstitions. Cast your bait into the abyss, luring and capturing hundreds of demons lurking below. <br><br>Utilize the power of alchemy to transmute your ill-gotten loot into potent bait, summoning and capturing the most terrifying demons in existence.<br><br>\ud83d\ude08 EXPLORE SCARY DEMONIC WORLDS<br><br>Discover the secrets of haunting oddities, scary worlds, and sacred altars as you lay claim to monsters and demons drawn from the legends of mystery. Unveil a world of blood, spells, and evil ghost spirits as you strive to become the ultimate demonic cult leader.<br><br>\ud83d\udcdc SIT TIBI VENARI PROSPERUM<br><br>An ancient Wiccan spell echoes through the ages, beckoning you to seize your fate and conquer the abyss. Sacrifice, Capture, Collect! Showcase your prowess as a deathly slayer and monster hunter, capturing demons and completing your demonic collection. Beware, for sometimes sacrifices of your collections and cultists are required.<br><br>\u2757 DISCLAIMER<br><br>Dillo Interactive and MLBC are not actual demonic cults \u2013 we\u2019re just from Austin. We don\u2019t care who worships what. Our only desire is for you to love our weird little game and share it with others. &lt;3",
